06:40.500 --> 06:45.840
The magician just shifted its carrier from a position I could see to a trajectory I couldn't.

06:46.140 --> 06:47.820
Like maybe slipping it up a sleeve.

06:47.880 --> 06:48.960
That's a great way to put it.

06:48.960 --> 06:54.860
And because the magician possesses the specific procedure to produce it from behind my ear a second later,

06:55.360 --> 06:58.540
the distinction was fully recoverable the entire time.

06:58.580 --> 06:59.440
It was never gone.

06:59.440 --> 07:04.020
The coin didn't cease to exist just because I lacked the architecture to read its new state.

07:04.600 --> 07:05.980
That analogy holds up beautifully.

