A bit is identical to whatever broad class of physical configurations can be correctly sorted back into the right categories by a future operation.

07:39.800 --> 07:44.840
That feels like a profound life lesson, just hiding in the computer science paper.

07:45.000 --> 07:45.820
It really does.

07:46.000 --> 07:55.480
I mean, I want to ask you, the listener, to pause and think about how often you judge a skill or a habit or even a relationship as gone,

