They've just migrated to a different dimension of our lives.

08:10.160 --> 08:11.900
It is a profound shift in perspective.

08:12.560 --> 08:20.800
But, you know, in the realm of computing, this philosophical assumption that identity must equal position has huge physical consequences.

08:20.960 --> 08:21.840
Real world costs.

