Let's translate that for those of us who don't wear lab coats to work.

09:13.420 --> 09:14.240
Fair enough.

09:14.620 --> 09:16.480
Let's start with the Josephson Junction.

09:16.980 --> 09:21.020
It's a foundational element of superconducting quantum computing.

09:21.400 --> 09:21.720
Okay.

09:21.720 --> 09:27.860
Imagine two pieces of superconducting metal cooled down to near absolute zero, so they have

