They ghost their way through the wall.

09:48.480 --> 09:49.940
In a manner of speaking, yeah, they do.

09:49.940 --> 09:55.560
So when you couple two of these circuits together, you create a system that can trap microscopic

09:55.560 --> 09:57.200
amounts of magnetic flux.

