And that is the secret ingredient here.

11:58.720 --> 11:58.820
Yeah.

11:58.900 --> 12:02.980
It means that the state of our device isn't just defined by its position in the landscape.

12:03.360 --> 12:06.320
You know, which bowl the marble is currently inside.

